{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Magic exists all around; your whole body and mind can be a conduit.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alice and Sophie have been in a long distance relationship since they graduated from the Ira Royal Academy for talented magic users. Sophie has stayed on campus as a researcher, while Alice ventured to the world outside of academia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, Sophie gets some time off, and the couple reunites for an onsen vacation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, things are not how they seem at the hot spring hotel... several mysterious events appear to target the Alice and Sophie. Is the hotel haunted, or is there a powerful magical enemy afoot?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Death Becomes You: Yuri Onsen Vacation* occurs after the events of *Death Becomes You*. It is not required to have read *Death Becomes You* or *A Summer with the Shiba Inu* by our developer friends, but there are some references to the two games that readers may appreciate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Kinetic visual novel (no choices)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ~8,000 word story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original sprite art, and 2 CGs (cutscenes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Extras gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Exclusive developer Q&amp;A</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam achievements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original game jam version launch option </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Enter the onsen.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3187380/8725a9f76fcd5d6b42564d37d183c146e25a7e08.jpg"},{"name":"Discover the source of the disturbance.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.